<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lightning bolt hits Johannesburg airport.</title>
<headline>Lightning bolt hits Johannesburg airport.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bolt of lightning struck the control tower at Johannesburg international airport, knocking out equipment and causing delays of an hour to incoming and outgoing flights, South African radio said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tower was struck during a violent electrical storm which persisted late into Tuesday.</p>
